        "response": "The task is fully complete. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n### \u2705 Task Complete\n\n**1. Read Q3 sales data** from `data/sales_q3.csv` \u2014 22 deal records across 3 sales reps (James Okafor, Sofia Delgado, Marcus Webb), 3 products, and 4 regions.\n\n**2. Extracted James Okafor's 3 won deals** (D001, D003, D006):\n\n| Deal ID | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|--------|---------|--------|------------|\n| D001 | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 |\n| D003 | East | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 |\n| D006 | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 |\n\n**3. Created `docs/q3_report.md`** (1,948 chars) with the following sections:\n- **Overview** \u2014 Introduces the three highlighted deals\n- **Deal Summary** \u2014 Table with all deal details (region, product, amount, close date, status)\n- **Key Metrics** \u2014 Total Revenue: **$250,500** | Average Deal Size: **$83,500** | Largest: D006 ($120,000) | Smallest: D003 ($43,000)\n- **Deal Details** \u2014 Individual breakdowns for each deal\n- **Observations** \u2014 Analysis of James's high-value closing ability, product breadth (Meridian Insights Pro + DataBridge), regional reach (North, East, South), and combined Q3 revenue impact\n\nThe report was verified by reading it back after writing \u2014 all content is accurate and derived directly from the real CSV data.",
