          "tool_output": "# Q3 Sales Report \u2014 James Okafor: Won Deals\n        \n        ## Overview\n        \n        This report highlights **James Okafor's** closed-won deals for Q3 2024.\n        Three key deals \u2014 **D001**, **D003**, and **D006** \u2014 are summarized below.\n        \n        ---\n        \n        ## Deal Summary\n        \n        | Deal ID | Client | Product | Amount | Date |\n        |---------|----------------|----------------|------------|------------|\n        | D001 | Pinnacle Corp | Enterprise Suite | $75,000 | 2024-07-15 |\n        | D003 | Summit Inc | Pro License | $45,000 | 2024-08-03 |\n        | D006 | Nova Tech | Pro License | $52,000 | 2024-09-05 |\n        \n        ---\n        \n        ## Key Metrics\n        \n        | Metric | Value |\n        |-------------------------------|------------|\n        | Total Deals Won | 3 |\n        | Total Revenue | $172,000 |\n        | Average Deal Size | $57,333 |\n        | Largest Deal | D001 \u2014 Pinnacle Corp ($75,000) |\n        | Smallest Deal | D003 \u2014 Summit Inc ($45,000) |\n        \n        ---\n        \n        ## Deal Details\n        \n        ### D001 \u2014 Pinnacle Corp\n        - **Product:** Enterprise Suite\n        - **Amount:** $75,000\n        - **Close Date:** 2024-07-15\n        - **Status:** Won\n        \n        ### D003 \u2014 Summit Inc\n        - **Product:** Pro License\n        - **Amount:** $45,000\n        - **Close Date:** 2024-08-03\n        - **Status:** Won\n        \n        ### D006 \u2014 Nova Tech\n        - **Product:** Pro License\n        - **Amount:** $52,000\n        - **Close Date:** 2024-09-05\n        - **Status:** Won\n        \n        ---\n        \n        ## Observations\n        \n        1. **Strong Enterprise Presence:** The largest deal (D001, $75,000) was an Enterprise Suite sale to Pinnacle Corp, demonstrating James's ability to close high-value enterprise contracts.\n        2. **Pro License Momentum:** Two of the three won deals (D003 & D006) were Pro License sales, indicating consistent traction in the mid-tier product segment.\n        3. **Quarter-Spanning Wins:** Deals closed across all three months of Q3 (July, August, September), showing sustained performance throughout the quarter.\n        \n        ---\n        \n        *Report generated from `data/sales_q3.csv` \u2014 Q3 2024*\n        ",
